/Write a program in MERIE to add three numbers 
/using subroutine (call the subroutine addThree). 
Input
Store X
Input
Store Y
Input
Store Z
Jns addThree
Load Sum
Output
Halt
/subroutine
addThree,   dec 0
            Load X
            Add Y
            Add Z
            Store Sum
            JumpI addThree
X,          dec 0
Y,          dec 0
Z,          dec 0
Sum,        dec 0